OL,3,AUK faces worst decade for household
OL,4,Aincomes, IFS think tank says, as it
OL,5,Awarns debt and growth problems remain
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe UK faces the "worst decade for
OL,8,Fhousehold income growth on record",
OL,9,Faccording to the head of the
OL,10,Finfluential Institute for Fiscal
OL,11,FStudies (IFS) think tank
OL,13,FHelen Miller says "no amount of
OL,14,Ftemporary cost of living packages"
OL,15,Fannounced in the Budget will fix that -
OL,16,Fand warns big debt and growth problems
OL,17,Fremain
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,303,300,200,140,0,100
