OL,3,AUK faces worst decade for household
OL,4,Aincomes, IFS think tank says, as it
OL,5,Awarns debt and growth problems remain
OL,6,
OL,7,FIt comes after the head of government
OL,8,Fspending watchdog the Office for Budget
OL,9,FResponsibility (OBR) warned the
OL,10,Fcountry's economic outlook is a "pretty
OL,11,Fgrim picture"
OL,13,FChancellor John Healey delivered his
OL,14,Ffirst Budget as chancellor on Wednesday
OL,15,F- he tells the BBC the government "can
OL,16,Fnever remove completely the cost of
OL,17,Fliving pressures that people feel"
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
